# Text is checked out with LF on every platform. A checkout with core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise write CRLF into apps/web/index.html and apps/web/public, and the release CID would
# change with the machine. VERIFY.md relies on this.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.car binary
